        <section xml:id="notes-week-03">
            <title>Classes 3-5</title>

            <p> Why doesn't the size of the House change anymore? 
                <url href="https://public.tableau.com/views/Apportionment_16116063135030/Apportionment?:language=en-US&amp;:sid=&amp;:redirect=auth&amp;:display_count=n&amp;:origin=viz_share_link">See how House would have to scale with the population over time at this interactive Census applet</url>
                </p>
                
            <p>
                Apportionment is rife with paradoxes. Let's dig in.
            </p>

            <subsection><title>That's not fair!</title>
